---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Kncelados"
  description="Terms of service for KNcelados Publisher, the internal tool KNcelados uses to publish its own short-form video content."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
    <p class="text-primary font-title text-sm tracking-widest uppercase">
      [ Legal ]
    </p>
    <h1 class="font-title mt-2 text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
      KNcelados Publisher — Terms of Service
    </h1>
    <p class="text-secondary mt-3 font-sans text-sm">
      Last updated: 17 November 2026
    </p>

    <p class="text-secondary mt-8 font-sans">
      KNcelados Publisher (registered on TikTok as <strong>knc-publisher</strong>) is
      an internal automation tool developed and operated by the KNcelados team. It
      is used exclusively to publish short-form video content created by KNcelados
      to social media accounts owned and controlled by KNcelados, including its
      TikTok account.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-title text-primary mt-10 text-xl">Scope of the service</h2>
    <p class="text-secondary mt-3 font-sans">
      The tool is not offered to third parties. It has no public sign-up and
      creates no user accounts. Nothing is published to any account other than
      those of its operators.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-title text-primary mt-10 text-xl">Responsibility</h2>
    <p class="text-secondary mt-3 font-sans">
      Operators are solely responsible for the content they publish through the
      tool, and for holding the rights to that content.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-title text-primary mt-10 text-xl">Warranty</h2>
    <p class="text-secondary mt-3 font-sans">
      The tool is provided “as is”, without warranty of any kind, express or
      implied. It may be modified, suspended or discontinued at any time.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-title text-primary mt-10 text-xl">Changes</h2>
    <p class="text-secondary mt-3 font-sans">
      These terms may be updated. The date above records the current version.
    </p>

    <p class="text-secondary mt-10 font-sans">
      Contact:
      <a
        href="mailto:hola@kncelados.com"
        class="font-title underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary"
        >hola@kncelados.com</a
      >
      ·
      <a
        href="/privacy"
        class="font-title underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary"
        >Privacy Policy</a
      >
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
